readme='''# K1/K2 semantic record reading: Astra design, Sol execution\n\nRead FINAL_MECHANISM_STATUS.md first. The full research objective remains active. This study tests a specific graph-directed ideal pair-message intervention under natural round states, following repository duplication/identifiability review. It does not prove G-local composition or a unique K1→K2 algorithm.\n\n12800 planned full two-loop scientific forwards:16dev/64confirm basegroups,32factorial inputs/group,fiveconditions/input. Actual counts and any prospective stops are explicit in COMPUTE_LEDGER.json and phase results. Four offered options include two mapping terminals and two nonpredicted decoys.\n\nV1 literalnativeKVrecompute failed its permutation-null numerical gate and is preserved. V2 adds the idealFP64 recordpair difference to actualBF16 nativeSDPA, with independently checked completeKV oracle. Constructednulls are engineering definitions. Read ASTRA_V2_PROTOCOL.md and NUMERICAL_OPERATOR_V1_FAILURE_AND_V2.md.\n\n## CPU reproduction\n\nPython3.10+, NumPy1.26.4; no GPU/checkpoint/network required for publicscalarreplay:\n\n```bash\npython code/reproduce_release.py\n```\n\nLarge JSONL is losslessgzip with SHA-verified shards. Replay restores exact frozen files and per-basegroup rows in a temporary folder, verifies all method/source/input freezes and regenerates available native/semantic summaries without changing the original analysis code. It is not a second neural forward implementation.\n\nALL_QUESTION_RESULTS contains each actual evaluated world, allcandidate logits/fullvocab-normalized logprobs/ties and allperrow actualdose/projectionnorms/events; INPUTS contains originaltexts,tokens,graphroles,positions. REFERENCE_PREFIX_PROVENANCE contains actual nativeprefixhash sources. Rawfull49152 heads and actualQ/K/Voracle witnesses remain on the server with RAW_TENSOR_MANIFEST. Modelweights/tokenizer are not redistributed.\n\n## Neural execution\n\nExact checkpoint/source hashes and software are in SOURCE_RUNTIME.json. Original frozen scalar analysis and operators are byte-preserved. Server original paths are in scripts; path adaptation requires an explicit reproduction workspace and fresh metadata deadline/version, while preserving all code/semantic gates. Stages: oldtechnicalV1(fails, archival), V2/V2R1 technical+CPUoracle, prepare/auditinputs, freeze_science.py, developmentnative→capability→interventions→semanticgate, then confirmationnative→capability→interventions→analysis. The three-process confirmation adapter changes only completebasegroup assignment/completion filenames; actual executedAST and amendments retained. No rerun of previous scientificstudies.\n\n## Repo review and next question\n\nEVIDENCE_AND_DUPLICATION_AUDIT.md distinguishes14 priorfamilies. DOCUMENT_INDEX.json covers310Markdown paths/271different byte-verified documents; this is catalog coverage, not a claim of independently rerunning every historicalexperiment. ASTRA_ISO_IDENTIFIABILITY_AND_NEXT_GATE.md explains the remaining Q/G interface test, missingeventlocalization/control and why it is not folded into this confirmation.\n\nNo independent agent neuralreplication is claimed. Astra designed/reviewed scientific scope and key code; Sol executed GPU, CPUoracle and scalar/vector self-audits.\n''';(R/'README.md').write_text(readme)
